#: simcontrols.js:48
msgid "Bromine water"
msgstr "Bromine water"

#: simcontrols.js:49
msgid "Saturated compound"
msgstr "Saturated compound"

#: simcontrols.js:50
msgid "Unsaturated compound"
msgstr "Unsaturated compound"

#: simcontrols.js:51
msgid ""
"Saturated compounds do not decolorize the <br>red-brown color of bromine "
"water."
msgstr ""
"Saturated compounds do not decolourise the <br>red-brown colour of bromine "
"water."

#: simcontrols.js:52
msgid ""
"When bromine water reacts with unsaturated compounds such as alkenes <br>or "
"alkynes, bromine will react with alkenes to produce dibromoalkanes <br>and "
"alkynes to produce tetrabromoalkanes.  When this reaction occurs, "
"<br>molecular bromine is consumed, and its characteristic dark red -brown "
"<br>color disappears."
msgstr ""
"When bromine water reacts with unsaturated compounds such as alkenes <br>or "
"alkynes, bromine will react with alkenes to produce dibromoalkanes <br>and "
"alkynes to produce tetrabromoalkanes.  When this reaction occurs, "
"<br>molecular bromine is consumed and its characteristic dark red -brown "
"<br>colour disappears."

#: simcontrols.js:53
msgid ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube A to drop <br>bromine water into the "
"saturated compound."
msgstr ""
"Drag the dropper to the test tube A to drop <br>bromine water into the "
"saturated compound."

#: simcontrols.js:53
msgid ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube B to drop <br>bromine water into the "
"unsaturated compound."
msgstr ""
"Drag the dropper to the test tube B to drop <br>bromine water into the "
"unsaturated compound."

#: simcontrols.js:55
msgid "Alkaline KMnO<sub>4</sub>"
msgstr "Alkaline KMnO<sub>4</sub>"

#: simcontrols.js:56
msgid ""
"Saturated compounds do not decolorize the <br>pink color of potassium "
"permanganate."
msgstr ""
"Saturated compounds do not decolourise the <br>pink colour of potassium "
"permanganate."

#: simcontrols.js:57
msgid ""
"When KMnO<sub>4</sub> reacts with unsaturated compounds such as alkenes or "
"<br>alkynes it oxidizes carbon-carbon double bond to give alkanediols and "
"<br>the carbon-carbon triple bond to give carboxylic acids. The pink colored "
"<br>permanganate is destroyed in the reaction, and a brown precipitate of "
"<br>MnO<sub>2</sub> produced."
msgstr ""
"When KMnO<sub>4</sub> reacts with unsaturated compounds such as alkenes or "
"<br>alkynes, it oxidizes carbon-carbon double bond to give alkanediols and "
"<br>the carbon-carbon triple bond to give carboxylic acids. The pink "
"coloured <br>permanganate is destroyed in the reaction, and a brown "
"precipitate of <br>MnO<sub>2</sub> produced."

#: simcontrols.js:58
msgid ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube A to drop alkaline <br>potassium "
"permanganate into the saturated compound."
msgstr ""
"Drag the dropper to the test tube A to drop alkaline <br>potassium "
"permanganate into the saturated compound."

#: simcontrols.js:58
msgid ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube B to drop alkaline <br>potassium "
"permanganate into the unsaturated compound."
msgstr ""
"Drag the dropper to the test tube B to drop alkaline <br>potassium "
"permanganate into the unsaturated compound."

