"Secondary alcohols react in about 1-5 minutes with Lucas reagent to <br>form "
"alkyl chloride, which being insoluble, results in <br>cloudiness in the "
"solution."

#: simcontrols.js:66
msgid ""
"On warming 1 alcohols react with Lucas reagent to form <br>alkyl chloride "
"which is being insoluble result in <br>cloudiness in the solution."
msgstr ""
"On warming, primary alcohols react with the Lucas reagent <br>to form alkyl "
"chloride, which being insoluble,  <br>results in cloudiness in the solution."

